    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:667019744b872f1b0f185127",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王的强烈意志，\n是想和憧憬的丸善斯基站在对等的立场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00dfa28afef514e3ae6bc5cc2161dd10efffbd8f60d839d0e4d23d39fda0e867",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4517d2c59fddf19eaa3eb247",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹的必死决心，\n是不惜赌上性命奔跑也要留下活过的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c81eb62f736772a9719bde1ecaffd1b5b6f0a8f11dd2b40c390929e76218ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a9b1fba9b8b7642242c8ca5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们各自怀抱的“执着”，\n逐渐转为对胜利的执着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "567717e96d0748e85098804d54eb05cba5635bbbd90556b7d7e46891c111543c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8001cc5f7eb9abe2bbdd2d47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超越“想赢”的意志。\n“绝对无法退让”的“执着”，\n才是在最后的最后决定胜负的关键。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd2a93f7796e6a84853a75ed76336eb8c24c101d7383e77048f944c9cc765b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fd2fde4ca98c719b711c153",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而“执着”无法由他人给予，\n只能靠自己寻找──",
      "source_fingerprint": "14eb5e4bc77f687e32663d6426147ec2f3ab7dfe9a2e246177649cbc2d28e936",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072314.json",
      "json_path": [
